      "text": "Bring your lunch or share the seasonal soup. Ingredients are listed."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 16,
      "text": "Make"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 17,
      "text": "&"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 18,
      "text": "mend"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 19,
      "text": "First Saturday, 2\u20133:30 pm"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 20,
      "text": "Bring a small repair or try a simple craft. Materials are provided."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 21,
      "text": "Plan a comfortable visit"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 22,
      "text": "An easy arrival"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 23,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 24,
      "text": "Enter through the wide gate beside the greenhouse."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 25,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 26,
      "text": "The main path is firm and level. Seating is available along the way."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 27,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 28,
      "text": "A welcome volunteer can show you the garden and the accessible restroom."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 29,
      "text": "Choose your pace"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 30,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 31,
      "text": "Take part seated or standing, or simply watch."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 32,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 33,
      "text": "Use the quiet corner whenever you would like a break."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 34,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 35,
      "text": "Ask for written instructions or a demonstration. Both are welcome."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 36,
      "text": "A small first step is enough"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 37,
      "text": "You do not have to know anyone, know what to say or stay all day. There is a place for you here."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 38,
      "text": "About this guide"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 39,
      "text": "Common Ground and its programs are fictional. This sample shows how a thoughtfully designed document can carry its structure into PDF and HTML."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 40,
      "text": "Fullbleed"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 41,
      "text": "documentation:"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "mcid": 42,
      "text": "docs.fullbleed.dev"
    }
